<title>PORTUGAL: Champalimaud banks to issue results Thursday.</title>
<headline>Champalimaud banks to issue results Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks from Portugal's Champalimaud group, including Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor, Banco Totta &amp; Acores and Credito Predial Portugues will issue their first half results on Thursday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>There had been market talk that the results would be issued on Tuesday after the market closed.</p>
<p>Banco Sotto has been gaining strongly on hopes for good figures for the first six months of the year.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
